				"category": "cleaningrobot",
				"tags": [
					"Control"
				],
				"readmeComment": "The Mi Home app has no separate stop: pause the cleaning and send the robot to the dock. Start sends the room cleaning command of the app without rooms (whole area). Zone cleaning: set the zone with the channel `set-zone`, then start it here. Point cleaning: start it with the channel `spot-clean`. The options here pause or resume zone and point cleaning. Not available (several values or structured data needed): saved map selection, map rename or delete, room split, merge and rename, virtual walls, room settings, schedules and voice pack download. Value mapping `[\"start-sweep\"\u003d\"Start or resume cleaning\",\"start-sweep-walls\"\u003d\"Start cleaning along walls\",\"pause\"\u003d\"Pause cleaning\",\"start-charge\"\u003d\"Return to dock\",\"stop-charge\"\u003d\"Stop returning to dock\",\"find-device\"\u003d\"Locate the robot\",\"pause-point-clean\"\u003d\"Pause point cleaning\",\"start-zone-clean\"\u003d\"Start or resume zone cleaning\",\"pause-zone-clean\"\u003d\"Pause zone cleaning\",\"wash-mop\"\u003d\"Wash the mop\",\"dry-mop\"\u003d\"Start drying the mop\",\"stop-wash-dry\"\u003d\"Stop mop washing or drying\",\"dust-collection\"\u003d\"Empty the dust box\",\"reset-main-brush\"\u003d\"Reset main brush life\",\"reset-side-brush\"\u003d\"Reset side brush life\",\"reset-dust-filter\"\u003d\"Reset dust box filter life\",\"reset-mop\"\u003d\"Reset mop life\",\"build-map\"\u003d\"Start quick mapping\",\"reset-map\"\u003d\"Reset the saved map\",\"set-calibration\"\u003d\"Level the robot\"]`"
			},
