ume\",\"2105\"\u003d\"Battery full\",\"2108\"\u003d\"Relocating\",\"2109\"\u003d\"Second cleaning pass\",\"2110\"\u003d\"Self-checking\",\"2111\"\u003d\"Generating map\",\"2112\"\u003d\"Building map\",\"2114\"\u003d\"Cleaned for 15 hours, empty the dust box\"]`"
